.TH TESSA-SESSION 1 "2026-10-27" "Tessa 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tessa-session \- display-manager entry point for Tessa
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tessa-session
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tessa-session
sets the Tessa session environment, prepends its installation directory to
.BR PATH ,
and starts
.BR tessa (1).
It is used by the
.I /usr/share/wayland-sessions/tessa.desktop
entry.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP
Set to
.BR Tessa .
.TP
.B XDG_SESSION_TYPE
Set to
.BR wayland .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tessa (1)
